::page[route="/book" title="BOOK"]

::hero[align=center transparent]
# Booking Is a Conversation

No set days, no rigid slots — Sam and her sister share one studio chair, so every booking starts as a request. Send yours below and you'll get a text back to confirm the details, human to human.
::

::features[cols=3]
### 1. Send the request

Tell us your idea, placement, size, and the days that work for you. Reference photos and Instagram links welcome — the more detail, the faster the yes.

### 2. Get instant answers

The studio assistant replies right away with pricing, aftercare, and availability info. Anything custom pings Sam directly on her phone — a real person confirms every booking before it's real.

### 3. Deposit & lock it in

Once you settle the details over text, you get a Square deposit link — pay it from your phone and your session lands on the shared studio-chair calendar, locked in.
::

::section
## Studio chair availability — one chair, two artists

Sam and Rae trade time on the same chair, so the calendar below shows when the chair itself is open — not fixed appointment slots. Picking a window here just attaches a time preference to your request (this is a demo — nothing is reserved until a human texts you to confirm).
::

